WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Ablations isolate each component.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:06.692
Starting from the full model at 43.1 mAP on the
multi-class task,

00:00:06.772 --> 00:00:12.842
reverting the Underwater Adaptive ViT block to the
original drops performance by 1.6 mAP,

00:00:12.922 --> 00:00:18.301
confirming that adapters help the frozen backbone
handle complex marine scenes.

00:00:18.381 --> 00:00:25.556
Replacing the Salient Feature Prompt Generator with
a generic Multi-scale Feature Enhancer costs 0.9 mAP,

00:00:25.636 --> 00:00:31.154
showing it does more than fuse features, it focuses
attention on salient regions.

00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:37.580
Further ablations on encoder freezing and the
convolution design confirm each choice matters.
